    "display_name": "西部劇（詰め所）",
    "id": "2103",
    "timezone": "1"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「やっほ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君咲学院West Side……通称『西部』へようこそ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしはこの町の治安を守る保安官（シェリフ）、兼、案内役の三波なつみだよ。よろしくね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……って、あれ？　転校生くん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「やっぱり、転校生くんも『西部』にきたんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君咲学院の全校生徒に、この『西部』への招待状が送られたって話だもんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「転校生くんが『西部』にいるのも、べつに不思議じゃないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「連休とはいえ暇なひとばっかりじゃないし、自由参加の課外活動って感じだもんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あんまり知りあいが参加してなくて、ちょっと寂しかったんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ともあれ、わたしたち美術部はこの『西部』の西部劇っぽい建物や小物の制作をしたり、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「衣装を仕立てたりしたんだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「この『西部』は、もともとは映画の撮影に用いられる巨大なセット……いわゆる映画村でね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「プロの建築家さんやデザイナーさんたちとも一緒にいろいろ制作できて、勉強になっちゃった♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたし、自分がつくったものの評判とか気になるほうだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『西部』に留まって、みんなの反応とか見てるんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「つくりが甘いところの微調整をしたり、壊れたところの修復をしたりもできるしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/normal/718"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしが着てるこの『保安官』の衣装も、自分でつくったんだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どうどう、けっこう上出来でしょ？　ばきゅ～ん☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「転校生くんも、『西部』で活動するなら西部劇っぽい衣装に着替えないとね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「衣装とか用意するよ、男物だとカウボーイかなぁ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょっと待ってね、出来合いの衣装を転校生くんの体格にあわせて縫製しちゃうから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょちょいのちょい、ってね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「とりあえず、拳銃だけ先に渡しておくね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あぁ安心して、本物の拳銃じゃないから。見た目は『それっぽい』けど、水鉄砲だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ここを開いて～、このチューブから水をいれるのね？　あとは引き金をひけば、水が発射できるよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ボトルが満タンの状態で、残弾は十六発ってとこかな♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「この『西部』ではけっこう、頻繁に撃ちあいがあるから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「残弾は定期的に補給して、常に満タンにしておいたほうがいいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『西部』では、この拳銃で互いに撃ちあうの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「拳銃に用いられる水は着色されてて、撃たれたら服が汚れてすぐわかる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「服が拳銃の水で汚れたら死亡＝アウトで、撃ちあいに参加する権利を失う」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「サバイバルゲームだよね、要するに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ、他人を撃ち殺すと『賞金首』として手配されて他のひとに狙われちゃうから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そんなバンバン撃つひとは珍しいけどね、いちおう注意しておいて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そんな『賞金首』を倒したり、ちょっとした仕事をすると『西部』だけで流通してるお金を得られる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『＄』とか、呼ぶんだけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「その『＄』で、『西部』のなかでお買いものができるから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「欲しいものがあるなら、『賞金首』を倒して『＄』を稼ごうね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「拳銃の水も『＄』で購入しないと補給できないから、気をつけて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ふつうの水は着色されてないし、それを拳銃にいれて撃っても『倒した』ことにならないんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「はい、最初に衣装と拳銃、あと所持金としてある程度の『＄』を支給するから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「とくに、『＄』は大事に使ってね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「食事とかも『＄』で支払うから、お金が尽きるとご飯も食べられない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ひもじい思いをしちゃうからね、他にも宿泊費とか交通費とかで何かと入り用だから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「逆に『＄』を稼ぐと、武器を拳銃よりもっと強力なものにバージョンアップしたりもできるよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「武器を換えたいなぁ、と思ったらわたしに言ってね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「この『保安官の詰め所』には武器庫があって、ライフルとか手榴弾とかいろいろ揃ってるんだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「手榴弾って、まぁ水風船なんだけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「基本ルールは、そんなとこ。あとは、この『西部』で何をしようが自由♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どんどん他人を襲って悪名高い『賞金首』になってもいいし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そういう無法者を退治する英雄になってもいい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「のんびり牛とか育てて、のほほんと暮らしてもいいんだよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしとふたりで、夫婦みたいに仲むつまじく暮らしてもいいんだよ～っ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ、何はともあれ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『西部』をたっぷり満喫してね、転校生くん♪」"
  }
]